[{"id":"CN-HTTP-010","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","CORS","预检"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>CORS 预检请求会携带什么，服务端需要证明什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>浏览器可能先发 OPTIONS，并携带 Origin、Access-Control-Request-Method、Access-Control-Request-Headers；服务端需返回匹配的 Allow-Origin、Allow-Methods、Allow-Headers 等许可。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>预检失败时实际请求可能根本没有发送；实际请求已有响应但脚本仍报错，则要检查响应读取权限和凭据规则。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-fixture-scope","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["pytest","Fixture"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(八)测试框架设计.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(八)测试框架设计","articlePath":"posts/c92e7868/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>可变的 BrowserContext、Page 和订单数据通常应使用什么作用域？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Function 级资源把状态污染限制在单条用例。只有创建成本高且本身可安全共享的只读资源，才考虑更大作用域。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>Session\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>全局单例\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>Function\u003c/p>\n"}]}]